ces or tabs). `line` is the\nline's content from its first marker to its last.","docLink":"./Lean/Data/Markdown/Block.html#Lean.Markdown.Block.Raw.thematicBreak","kind":"ctor","line":214,"name":"Lean.Markdown.Block.Raw.thematicBreak","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Data/Markdown/Block.lean#L214-L218"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">constructor</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Data/Markdown/Block.html#Lean.Markdown.Block.Raw.linkRefDef\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Markdown</span>.<span class=\"name\">Block</span>.<span class=\"name\">Raw</span>.<span class=\"name\">linkRefDef</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">s</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Data/String/Defs.html#String.Slice\">String.Slice</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">m</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Data/Markdown/Inline.html#Lean.Markdown.RefDef\">RefDef</a> <span class=\"fn\">s</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Data/Markdown/Block.html#Lean.Markdown.Block.Raw\">Raw</a> <span class=\"fn\">s</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"A link reference definition, which is written `[label]: destination \"title\"` (the title is\noptional).","docLink":"./Lean/Data/Markdown/Block.html#Lean.Markdown.Block.Raw.linkRefDef","kind":"ctor","line":209,"name":"Lean.Markdown.Block.Raw.linkRefDef","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Data/Markdown/Block.lean#L209-L213"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">constructor</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Data/Markdown/Block.html#Lean.Markdown.Block.R