ion.","docLink":"./Lean/Data/Markdown/Block.html#Lean.Markdown.Block.Raw.indentedCode","kind":"ctor","line":186,"name":"Lean.Markdown.Block.Raw.indentedCode","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Data/Markdown/Block.lean#L186-L190"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">constructor</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Data/Markdown/Block.html#Lean.Markdown.Block.Raw.fencedCode\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Markdown</span>.<span class=\"name\">Block</span>.<span class=\"name\">Raw</span>.<span class=\"name\">fencedCode</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">s</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Data/String/Defs.html#String.Slice\">String.Slice</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">info</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Data/Markdown/Block.html#Lean.Markdown.FenceInfo\">FenceInfo</a> <span class=\"fn\">s</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">openFence</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">s</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/String/Subslice.html#String.Slice.Subslice\">Subslice</a></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">closeFence?</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Option\">Option</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">s</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/String/Subslice.html#String.Slice.Subslice\">Subslice</a></span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">lines</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Array\">Array</a> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./Lean/Data/Markdown/Block.html#Lean.Markdown.VerbatimLine\">VerbatimLine</a> <span class=\"fn\">s</span>)</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_ar